{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739240413269065890","content":"okay, four questions\n1: how does using our labor in a day affect our ability to rp? are we limited to roughly the location of the merchant's shop? if so, how long out of the day are we there?\n2: what is the reward for working under a merchant as a serf? is that negotiated on an individual basis?\n3: if we're a serf, what exactly is the point of our building for anything besides rp? do we have the ability to sell things?\n4: how would I change my role? i'm feeling somewhat conflicted as it makes the most sense in a vacuum for Web to be a serf, but it feels like if I want them to do their weaving, waste management, a merchant makes more sense.","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:22:11.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739563721214394429","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
